	Builder HTML + Code.gs & API Metering
	Builders craft apps in Google AI Studio. Requests pass through a Supabase Edge Function gateway that logs api_calls and payload size per user/app, enforces usage quotas, and proxies authorized calls to Drive or Code.gs endpoints.
